window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-f449586d4612e83c"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"features\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">功能</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。如需查看文档的 Markdown 版本，可在页面 URL 末尾追加 <code>.md</code>。</p> </blockquote> <p>ChatGPT 将项目和长期运行的聊天与网页浏览、文件、图像和插件整合在一起。命令、设置和故障排除参考内容也覆盖这些工作流程，帮助你选择合适的工作方式，并为每个聊天提供所需的上下文和工具。</p> <p>探索在 ChatGPT 中开展工作的流程、能力、命令和设置。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">浏览项目和聊天</a> <a id=\"workflows\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_2\">工作流程</h2> <p>组织、委派和检查工作的方式。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">项目和聊天</a> — 将相关聊天、上下文和工作集中在一起。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e49d01f23299a44c\">移动端 Codex</a> — 在手机上启动任务、批准操作并检查工作。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0d81218eacd2463c\">构建插件</a> — 在与 ChatGPT 的对话中创建并改进可复用的工作流程。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-989576428b6123b7\">可视化</a> — 将想法和信息转化为交互式可视化说明。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a> — 安排重复执行的工作并检查已完成的结果。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-916e12c5bba5b9cc\">长时间运行的工作</a> — 你暂时离开时，也可以让 ChatGPT 继续工作。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">通知</a> — 选择当工作需要关注时 ChatGPT 如何通知你。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets</a> — 选择一个伙伴、开始聊天并跟踪其动态。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0169dfa5d4e3e205\">Codex Micro</a> — 通过 Work Louder 键盘监控和控制 ChatGPT 聊天。 <a id=\"capabilities\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_3\">能力</h2> <p>ChatGPT 可用于理解、创作和执行操作的工具。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">浏览器</a> — 让 ChatGPT 浏览网站并执行操作，同时由你掌控。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">计算机使用</a> — 让 ChatGPT 通过可视化界面与应用交互。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT Voice</a> — 在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中，于 Chat、Work 和 Codex 使用语音功能。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-acc8cb67be71d07d\">Composer Predictions</a> — 获取 Codex 下一条消息的建议。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a> — 安装可复用的工作流程、已连接的工具和共享上下文。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-60fa4628ebb92b18\">使用 ChatGPT 登录</a> — 在其他应用中使用你的 ChatGPT 账户，并选择这些应用如何使用你的套餐。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-eb946260804133fb\">网页搜索</a> — 查找最新信息，并将来源带入任务。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-6e5b50840145f8df\">图像生成</a> — 在工作过程中创建和编辑图像。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">图像输入</a> — 将屏幕截图和图像用作 ChatGPT 的上下文。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshots</a> — 捕获应用状态，以便进行目视检查和调试。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">浏览器扩展</a> — 在 Chrome、Edge、Brave、Opera 或 Vivaldi 中使用 ChatGPT。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">使用文件</a> — 创建、预览并改进文档和其他生成的文件。</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"sites\">Sites</h2> <p>在 ChatGPT 中构建、连接、发布和管理网站。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">概览</a> — 了解可以构建什么，以及可用范围和限制。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-56e8c36f028eb49f\">创建站点</a> — 在 ChatGPT 中描述、构建并改进网站。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e0f092cc982945c2\">数据与连接</a> — 保存记录、连接应用，并为站点添加登录功能。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-fc9cd7880ec6ce59\">发布与共享</a> — 检查站点、选择受众并邀请编辑者。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-8063f9ed486db057\">管理站点</a> — 查看分析数据、更改设置并管理站点版本。</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-dots\">ChatGPT dots</h2> <p>设置你的 dot 并管理其持续执行的工作。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">概览</a> — 了解你的 dot 及其连接。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7c8e52e0c73fc7d7\">入门</a> — 创建你的 dot 并为其指定职责。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-4b4aabd54f9e5c9c\">消息</a> — 在 ChatGPT 和已连接的渠道中联系你的 dot。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-9ffa6664dba73aa2\">任务与记忆</a> — 了解定时工作、上下文和研究。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-6e39401d1f472a38\">计算机与应用</a> — 连接工具并检查计算机操作。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e13354c6b025f6aa\">控制</a> — 检查活动、管理规则并停止工作。</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-space\">ChatGPT Space</h2> <p>通过 ChatGPT 与协作者在 Pages 中共同推进工作。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-9eaf251f273c9bc9\">Space 概览</a> — 查找文件和 Pages，并使用 ChatGPT 推进工作。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-71293722d815f9b8\">入门</a> — 起草你的第一个 Page。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">Pages</a> — 撰写、整理和修订你的内容。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">与智能体协作</a> — 为 ChatGPT 提供上下文、边界和明确任务。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-418e376165928c0b\">协作</a> — 选择谁可以查看、评论或编辑你的内容。 <a id=\"reference\"></a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_4\">参考</h2> <p>查找 ChatGPT 桌面应用的命令和设置。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dd7bb821828a3c32\">命令</a> — 使用应用命令、键盘快捷键和深层链接。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-6c3aed9dab628df5\">斜杠命令</a> — 使用常见交互操作的快捷命令。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1e04f0e469568257\">设置</a> — 配置 ChatGPT 桌面应用的偏好设置。</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-11ef3e151227c2a8\">故障排除</a> — 解决 ChatGPT 桌面应用中的常见问题。</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"features\">Features</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>ChatGPT brings projects and long-running chats together with web browsing, files, images, and plugins. Commands, settings, and troubleshooting references round out these workflows, from choosing the right workflow to giving each chat the context and tools it needs.</p> <p>Explore workflows, capabilities, commands, and settings for working in ChatGPT.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Explore projects and chats</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"workflows\">Workflows</h2> <p>Ways to organize, delegate, and review work.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3353f8f8f4d90d76\">Projects and chats</a> — Keep related chats, context, and work together.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e49d01f23299a44c\">Codex on mobile</a> — Start tasks, approve actions, and review work from your phone.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0d81218eacd2463c\">Build plugins</a> — Create and refine reusable workflows in a conversation with ChatGPT.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-989576428b6123b7\">Visualizations</a> — Turn ideas and information into interactive visual explanations.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a> — Schedule recurring work and review completed results.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-916e12c5bba5b9cc\">Long-running work</a> — Let ChatGPT continue working while you step away.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-30bc4c9993999e92\">Notifications</a> — Choose how ChatGPT tells you when work needs attention.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-74fe1167725e9c4d\">Pets</a> — Choose a companion, start chats, and follow activity.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-0169dfa5d4e3e205\">Codex Micro</a> — Monitor and control ChatGPT chats from a Work Louder keyboard.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"capabilities\">Capabilities</h2> <p>Tools ChatGPT can use to understand, create, and take action.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-a7de5b39bd26a809\">Browser</a> — Let ChatGPT browse websites and take action while you stay in control.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer use</a> — Let ChatGPT interact with apps through the visual interface.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3b6d55bd01328040\">ChatGPT Voice</a> — Try voice in Chat, Work, and Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-acc8cb67be71d07d\">Composer Predictions</a> — Get suggestions for your next message in Codex.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a> — Install reusable workflows, connected tools, and shared context.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-60fa4628ebb92b18\">Sign in with ChatGPT</a> — Use your ChatGPT account in other apps and choose how they use your plan.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-eb946260804133fb\">Web search</a> — Find current information and bring sources into a task.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-6e5b50840145f8df\">Image generation</a> — Create and edit images as part of your work.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b64a9457088d1171\">Image inputs</a> — Use screenshots and images as context for ChatGPT.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c302b8efa03eab38\">Appshots</a> — Capture app state for visual inspection and debugging.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-a7459570776840aa\">Browser extension</a> — Use Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, or Vivaldi with ChatGPT.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1186da4cb8c2d6e2\">Work with files</a> — Create, preview, and refine documents and other generated files.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"sites\">Sites</h2> <p>Build, connect, publish, and manage websites in ChatGPT.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Overview</a> — Explore what you can build and find availability and limits.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-56e8c36f028eb49f\">Create a site</a> — Describe, build, and refine a website in ChatGPT.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e0f092cc982945c2\">Data and connections</a> — Save records, connect apps, and add sign-in to your site.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-fc9cd7880ec6ce59\">Publish and share</a> — Review your site, choose its audience, and invite editors.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-8063f9ed486db057\">Manage a site</a> — Review analytics, change settings, and manage site versions.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-dots\">ChatGPT dots</h2> <p>Set up your dot and manage its ongoing work.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1323ad8861010e1b\">Overview</a> — Understand your dot and its connections.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7c8e52e0c73fc7d7\">Getting started</a> — Create your dot and give it a responsibility.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-4b4aabd54f9e5c9c\">Messaging</a> — Contact your dot in ChatGPT and connected channels.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-9ffa6664dba73aa2\">Tasks and memory</a> — Understand scheduled work, context, and research.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-6e39401d1f472a38\">Computers and apps</a> — Connect tools and inspect computer work.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-e13354c6b025f6aa\">Controls</a> — Review activity, manage rules, and stop work.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"chatgpt-space\">ChatGPT Space</h2> <p>Develop shared work in Pages with ChatGPT and collaborators.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-9eaf251f273c9bc9\">Space overview</a> — Find files and Pages, and develop your work with ChatGPT.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-71293722d815f9b8\">Getting started</a> — Draft your first Page.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-c7393fbab700d02d\">Pages</a> — Write, organize, and revise your work.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2d083870d670ea3a\">Work with the agent</a> — Give ChatGPT context, boundaries, and a clear task.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-418e376165928c0b\">Collaboration</a> — Choose who can view, comment on, or edit your work.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"reference\">Reference</h2> <p>Find commands and settings for the ChatGPT desktop app.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dd7bb821828a3c32\">Commands</a> — Use app commands, keyboard shortcuts, and deep links.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-6c3aed9dab628df5\">Slash commands</a> — Use shortcuts for common interactive actions.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-1e04f0e469568257\">Settings</a> — Configure ChatGPT desktop app preferences.</li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-11ef3e151227c2a8\">Troubleshooting</a> — Resolve common issues in the ChatGPT desktop app.</li> </ul>"};
